# Build context of deploy/docker/Dockerfile, as an allowlist: local secrets
# (.env.local, diffyman.toml), build output, caches and the toolchain file
# never enter the build.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!.sqlx/
!crates/
!bindings/*/Cargo.toml
!bindings/*/build.rs
!bindings/*/src/
!docs/spec/diff-document.md
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/*.node
**/*.so
